# UX — navigation & sheets

[docs/ux-flows.md](../../docs/ux-flows.md) · [docs/shared-components.md](../../docs/shared-components.md) · [docs/visual-reference.md](../../docs/visual-reference.md)

## Primary navigation (**confirmed owner override**)

Supersedes index.html bottom bar **and** older “≤5 tabs with center + slot” docs.

- **Four destinations** inside a floating **pill / island**: Home, Clients, Supplier/craftsman **directory**, Items.
- **New voucher (+):** separate **circular satellite** adjacent to the **end** of the pill — **not** a fifth tab, **not** a huge centered FAB. **Open:** which physical end (LTR vs RTL), exact diameters, and satellite offset — owner has **not** locked; do not silently codify in code without sign-off.
- **No** dedicated summary tab.
- Content **scrolls behind** the dock. Apply bottom **surface gradient** (light: white fade; dark: adaptive) with **`IgnorePointer`** so scrolling/taps pass through the fade. Add **scroll bottom padding** so the last card is not hidden under pill + satellite + safe area.

Voucher remains reachable from **+** and contextual entry points in [ux-flows.md](../../docs/ux-flows.md).

## Sheets & inline create

- **One** `CustomBottomSheet` at a time; nested **local** `Navigator` for inline-create (Bnood extension — SmartRx sheet has no nested navigator).
- Never stack sheets or parallel `showModalBottomSheet` + dialog for the same flow.
- Materials/labor: **segmented** control. Cash/transfer only.
- Receive: hide expense fields. Client change: clear invalid craftsman.
- Green incoming / red outgoing movement styling.
- Sheet height: **content-sized**; drag handle; no duplicated title (sheet chrome vs inner route).
- `useRootNavigator: true` from shell routes so dock does not cover actions.

## Visual parity

Index remains reference for **non-nav** UI. Current Flutter shell may still show legacy 5-tab layout — tracked as UI-06 in [ui-acceptance.md](../../docs/ui-acceptance.md).
